   "css": "/* JS: el.style.setProperty('--d', Math.abs(i - (n - 1) / 2)) */\n.c { display:inline-block; opacity:0; animation: show .45s cubic-bezier(.215,.61,.355,1) forwards;\n  animation-delay: calc(var(--d) * 30ms); }\n@keyframes show { from { opacity:0; transform:scale(.86); } to { opacity:1; transform:none; } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .c { animation:none; opacity:1; } }",
   "ae": "1. 애니메이터: 불투명도 0%\n2. 레인지 셀렉터 삭제 → 추가 → 셀렉터 → 표현식\n3. 양에:\n   c = (textTotal + 1) / 2; delay = 1 * thisComp.frameDuration;\n   d = Math.abs(textIndex - c) * delay;\n   ease(time - inPoint, d, d + 6 * thisComp.frameDuration, 100, 0)",
