   "css": "/* <del class=\"old\">싸다</del><ins class=\"new\">초저가</ins> */\n.old { position:relative; text-decoration:none; animation: dim .2s .3s both; }\n.old::after { content:''; position:absolute; left:-2px; right:-2px; top:52%; height:.07em; background:var(--accent);\n  transform:scaleX(0); transform-origin:left; animation: strike .3s cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1) forwards; }\n.new { display:inline-block; text-decoration:none; color:var(--accent);\n  animation: pop .5s cubic-bezier(.34,1.8,.64,1) .5s both; }\n@keyframes strike { to { transform:scaleX(1); } }\n@keyframes dim { to { opacity:.4; } }\n@keyframes pop { from { opacity:0; transform:scale(.6); } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .old, .old::after, .new { animation-duration:1ms; animation-delay:0s; } }",
   "gsap": "gsap.timeline()\n  .fromTo('.old-line', { scaleX: 0 }, { scaleX: 1, transformOrigin: 'left center', duration: .3, ease: 'power2.inOut' })\n  .to('.old', { opacity: .4, duration: .2 })\n  .from('.new', { scale: .6, autoAlpha: 0, duration: .5, ease: 'back.out(2)' }, '+=.2');",
   "motion": "import { animate } from 'motion';\nawait animate('.old-line', { scaleX: [0, 1] }, { duration: .3, ease: [.65, 0, .35, 1] });\nanimate('.old', { opacity: .4 }, { duration: .2 });\nanimate('.new', { opacity: [0, 1], scale: [.6, 1] }, { delay: .2, type: 'spring', stiffness: 400, damping: 14 });",
   "ae": "1. 이전 단어 레이어 위에 셰이프 직선, 패스 트리밍 끝 0 → 100%(9프레임)\n2. 이전 단어 불투명도 100 → 40%\n3. 새 단어 레이어: 6프레임 뒤 스케일 60 → 110 → 100%, 불투명도 0 → 100%\n4. 신조어를 살짝 기울이고 손글씨풍의 '∧」를 곁들인다",
   "aeEn": "1. Shape line over the old word, Trim Paths End 0 → 100% (9 frames)\n2. Old word Opacity 100 → 40%\n3. New word layer 6 frames later: Scale 60 → 110 → 100%, Opacity 0 → 100%\n4. Tilt the new word slightly and add a hand-drawn caret"
