  "recipes": {
   "css": ".type { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden;\n  width: 0; border-right: .12em solid currentColor;\n  animation: typing 0.7s steps(10, end) forwards, caret .75s step-end infinite; }\n@keyframes typing { to { width: 10ch; } }          /* 10 = 글자 수 */\n@keyframes caret  { 50% { border-color: transparent; } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .type { animation: none; width: auto; } }",
   "remotion": "const frame = useCurrentFrame(); const { fps } = useVideoConfig();\nconst chars = Array.from(text); const n = Math.min(chars.length, Math.floor(frame / 2)); // 2f/글자\nconst typing = n < chars.length;\nconst caretOn = typing || Math.floor(frame / (fps * 0.375)) % 2 === 0;\nreturn <div style={{ fontFamily: 'monospace' }}>{chars.slice(0, n).join('')}\n  <span style={{ opacity: caretOn ? 1 : 0 }}>|</span></div>;",
   "ae": "1. 텍스트 레이어(고정폭 폰트)의 소스 텍스트에 표현식:\n   cps = 15; s = text.sourceText; n = Math.floor((time - inPoint) * cps);\n   s.substr(0, n) + ((n < s.length || Math.floor(time * 2) % 2 == 0) ? \"|\" : \" \")\n2. 끝 공백으로 폭이 흔들리지 않도록 문단은 왼쪽 정렬로",
   "aeEn": "1. On a monospaced text layer, Source Text expression:\n   cps = 15; s = text.sourceText; n = Math.floor((time - inPoint) * cps);\n   s.substr(0, n) + ((n < s.length || Math.floor(time * 2) % 2 == 0) ? \"|\" : \" \")\n2. Left-align the paragraph so the caret space does not shift the line"
  },
