   "aeEn": "1. Text layer → More Options → Anchor Point Grouping: Character, Grouping Alignment (0, −50%)\n2. Animate: Rotation 90°\n3. Add Selector → Expression, Amount:\n   d = 0.06*textIndex; t = Math.max(0, time - inPoint - d);\n   100 * Math.exp(-2.25*t) * Math.cos(9.2*t)"
