   "aeEn": "1. Duplicate the text (Ctrl+D); top-half rectangle mask on one, bottom-half on the other\n2. Top: Position x −200 → 0, bottom: +200 → 0 (0.5–0.8 s)\n3. Strong ease-out on the end keys (Speed Graph influence ~80%)"
