  "recipes": {
   "css": ".bar { position: relative; }\n.bar::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: var(--accent);\n  transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left; animation: bar .8s ease-in-out forwards; }\n.bar > span { clip-path: inset(0 100% 0 0); animation: show .4s ease-in-out .4s forwards; }\n@keyframes bar { 50% { transform: scaleX(1); transform-origin: left; } 50.01% { transform-origin: right; } 100% { transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: right; } }\n@keyframes show { to { clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0); } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .bar::after { display: none; } .bar > span { animation: none; clip-path: none; } }",
   "gsap": "gsap.timeline()\n  .fromTo('.bar-fill', { scaleX: 0, transformOrigin: 'left center' }, { scaleX: 1, duration: .4, ease: 'power2.inOut' })\n  .set('.bar-fill', { transformOrigin: 'right center' })\n  .to('.bar-fill', { scaleX: 0, duration: .4, ease: 'power2.inOut' })\n  .fromTo('.bar-text', { clipPath: 'inset(0 100% 0 0)' }, { clipPath: 'inset(0 0% 0 0)', duration: .4, ease: 'power2.inOut' }, '<');",
   "ae": "1. 사각 셰이프(바)를 만들고 앵커를 왼쪽 끝에 → 스케일 X 0 → 100%(0.4초)\n2. 앵커를 오른쪽 끝으로 옮긴 두 번째 바(또는 같은 레이어에서 위치 보정)로 100 → 0%(0.4초)\n3. 텍스트에 리니어 와이프(90°) 적용, 변환 종료를 바 뒤 끝에 맞춰 100 → 0%",
   "aeEn": "1. Rectangle shape bar, anchor on the left → Scale X 0 → 100% (0.4 s)\n2. Anchor moved to the right edge → 100 → 0% (0.4 s)\n3. Linear Wipe (90°) on the text, Transition Completion 100 → 0% synced to the bar’s trailing edge"
  },
