   "aeEn": "1. Effect → Transition → Venetian Blinds on the text layer\n2. Direction 0°, Width ~8 px\n3. Transition Completion 100% → 0% over 0.6 s. For a per-slat stagger, duplicate the text per strip with rectangle masks and offset them"
