  "recipes": {
   "css": ".shiny { --w: 100px; color: rgb(232 235 243 / .55);\n  background: linear-gradient(120deg, transparent 40%, #fff 50%, transparent 60%) 0 0 / var(--w) 100% no-repeat;\n  -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text;\n  animation: shiny 6s cubic-bezier(.6,.6,0,1) infinite; }\n@keyframes shiny {\n  0%, 90%, 100% { background-position: calc(-100% - var(--w)) 0; }\n  30%, 60% { background-position: calc(100% + var(--w)) 0; }\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .shiny { animation: none; } }",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 80\"><defs>\n  <linearGradient id=\"shine\" gradientTransform=\"rotate(30)\" x1=\"-.3\" x2=\".0\">\n    <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#9aa3b5\"/><stop offset=\".5\" stop-color=\"#fff\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#9aa3b5\"/>\n    <animate attributeName=\"x1\" values=\"-.3;1\" dur=\"1.2s\" begin=\"0s;a.end+3s\" id=\"a\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <animate attributeName=\"x2\" values=\"0;1.3\" dur=\"1.2s\" begin=\"a.begin\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n  </linearGradient></defs>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"48\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"url(#shine)\">Premium</text></svg>",
   "ae": "1. 텍스트 레이어에 이펙트 → 그리기 → CC Light Sweep\n2. Direction -30°、Width 50、Sweep Intensity 60\n3. Center의 X를 글자 왼쪽 밖 → 오른쪽 밖으로 0.6~1.2초에 키프레임\n4. 빨리 들어와 늦게 나가는 이즈(그래프로 출구 쪽을 길게), 몇 초 간격으로 반복",
   "aeEn": "1. Text layer → Effect → Generate → CC Light Sweep\n2. Direction -30°, Width 50, Sweep Intensity 60\n3. Keyframe Center X from left of the text to right of it over 0.6–1.2 s\n4. Fast-in / slow-out ease; repeat after a few seconds of rest"
  },
