  "descriptionEn": "A colour band passes left to right through grey text, leaving each character saturated behind it.",
  "focus": "띠의 선두는 밝은 색, 통과 후에는 본래 색. 회색 → 빛 → 본래 색의 3단으로 「색이 부어졌다」처럼 보인다.",
  "focusEn": "The leading edge of the band is a bright tint and the colour behind it is the final one: grey → light → final colour reads as colour being poured in.",
