  "focusEn": "Progress is position, not time: it starts as the element crosses the bottom edge (entry 0%) and completes at cover 35%. Each word starts a little later, so later words catch up over a shorter range.",
  "caution": "animation-timeline은 미대응 브라우저가 있으므로 @supports로 감싸고 미대응에서는 처음부터 표시한다(opacity 0으로 남기지 않음). 아래에서의 이동량을 0.4em 정도로 억제하면 행 겹침이 생기지 않는다.",
  "cautionEn": "animation-timeline isn't supported everywhere: wrap it in @supports and show text by default (never leave it at opacity 0). Keep the rise to ~0.4em so lines don't collide.",
