  "descriptionEn": "Characters or words are added one by one at fixed positions; once on screen, they never move.",
  "focus": "최종 위치는 처음에 정해져 있고(점선), 글자는 그 자리에 덧써질 뿐. 줄바꿈이나 중앙 정렬이 중간에 바뀌지 않으므로 시선을 다시 찾을 필요가 없다.",
  "focusEn": "Final positions are fixed from the start (dotted slots) and glyphs are simply written into them. Wrapping and centring never change mid-way, so the eye never has to re-find the line.",
