  "titleEn": "Infinite Marquee",
  "pattern": "text-infinite-marquee",
  "duration": 6000,
  "motionDuration": 20000,
  "easing": "linear",
  "feelings": [
   "부드러움"
  ],
  "usages": [
   "텍스트",
   "UI"
  ],
  "description": "글자의 밴드가 이음새 없이 가로로 흘러가고 행마다 채움과 윤곽·흐르는 방향이 번갈아 바뀐다.",
  "descriptionEn": "A band of text scrolls sideways forever without a seam; rows alternate between filled and outlined type and between directions.",
  "focus": "같은 문자열을 2개 나열하고 정확히 하나분(전체의 -50%) 움직인 지점에서 0으로 되돌리므로 이음새가 보이지 않는다. 위 눈금이 복사본 경계. 채움·밴드·윤곽과 방향을 번갈아 쓰면 단조롭지 않다.",
  "focusEn": "The text is duplicated and the track jumps back to 0 exactly when it has moved one copy (-50% of the track), so no seam shows. The ticks on the top row mark copy boundaries. Alternating fill, band and outline — and direction — keeps it from feeling flat.",
  "caution": "계속 움직이는 밴드는 읽히지 않는다는 전제로 내용은 짧은 반복으로. 복제는 스크린리더에 2번 읽히지 않게 aria-hidden에. 호버로 멈추고, prefers-reduced-motion에서는 정지(WCAG 2.2.2: 5초 이상 움직이는 것은 멈출 수 있어야).",
  "cautionEn": "Assume a moving band is glanced at, not read — keep it to a short repeating phrase. Mark the duplicate aria-hidden so it isn’t read twice, pause on hover and stop under prefers-reduced-motion (WCAG 2.2.2: anything moving longer than 5s must be pausable).",
  "tips": [],
  "tipsEn": [],
  "recipe": "translateX 0 → -50% / 2 copies / 10–20s linear infinite / outline 1–2px",
  "recipeEn": "translateX 0 → -50% / 2 copies / 10–20s linear infinite / outline 1–2px",
  "curve": "standard",
  "trigger": "시간·상태 변화",
  "triggerEn": "Time or state change",
  "tech": [
   "CSS",
   "AE"
  ],
  "cost": "가벼움",
  "costEn": "Light",
  "inputs": [
   "자동"
  ],
  "inputsEn": [
   "Automatic"
  ],
  "reduced": "동작을 멈추고 글자가 읽히는 대표 컷을 표시합니다.",
  "reducedEn": "Stop the motion and show a representative frame where the text is readable.",
  "accent": "yellow",
  "featured": false,
  "values": [
   "translateX 0 → -50%",
   "2 copies",
   "10–20s linear infinite",
   "outline 1–2px"
  ],
  "valuesEn": [
   "translateX 0 → -50%",
   "2 copies",
   "10–20s linear infinite",
   "outline 1–2px"
  ],
  "recipes": {
   "css": "<div class=\"marquee\"><div class=\"track\">\n  <span>NEW IN • NEW IN • </span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">NEW IN • NEW IN • </span>\n</div></div>\n\n.marquee { overflow: hidden; }\n.track { display: flex; width: max-content; animation: run 20s linear infinite; }\n.track span { flex: none; white-space: nowrap; padding-right: .5em; }\n.row-2 .track { animation-direction: reverse; }\n.row-3 .track span { color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px currentColor; }\n@keyframes run { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }\n.marquee:hover .track { animation-play-state: paused; }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .track { animation: none; } }",
   "waapi": "const track = document.querySelector('.track');\ntrack.append(track.firstElementChild.cloneNode(true)); // 두 번째(aria-hidden을 붙인다)\ntrack.lastElementChild.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');\nconst anim = track.animate([{ transform: 'translateX(0)' }, { transform: 'translateX(-50%)' }],\n  { duration: 20000, iterations: Infinity, easing: 'linear' });\ntrack.addEventListener('pointerenter', () => anim.pause());\ntrack.addEventListener('pointerleave', () => anim.play());",
   "ae": "1. 텍스트를 2회 이어 붙인 1행을 만든다(사이에 구분 기호)\n2. 위치 X: 0f에서 0, 끝에서 「1복사분 폭」만큼 왼쪽으로(리니어)\n3. 루프: loopOut(\"cycle\") 를 표현식에\n4. 2행째는 복제해 방향을 반전, 3행째는 채움 없음 + 선 1.5px",
   "aeEn": "1. Build one line containing the text twice (with a separator)\n2. Position X: 0 at frame 0 → one copy-width to the left at the end (linear)\n3. Loop with the expression loopOut(\"cycle\")\n4. Duplicate for row 2 with the direction reversed; row 3 no fill + 1.5px stroke"
  },
  "sources": [
   "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@media/prefers-reduced-motion",
   "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kinetic_typography"
  ],
