  "recipes": {
   "css": "/* 1바퀴 2.4s 중 처음 0.4s(16.7%)만 뜀 */\n.hop span { display:inline-block; transform-origin: 50% 100%;\n  animation: hop 2.4s infinite; animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * .1s); }\n@keyframes hop {\n  0%     { transform: translateY(0); animation-timing-function: ease-out; }\n  8.3%   { transform: translateY(-40%); animation-timing-function: ease-in; }\n  16.7%  { transform: translateY(0) scale(1.1, .86); }\n  22%, 100% { transform: none; } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .hop span { animation: none; } }",
   "gsap": "const split = SplitText.create('.hop', { type: 'chars' });\ngsap.timeline({ repeat: -1, repeatDelay: 1 })\n  .to(split.chars, { yPercent: -40, duration: .2, ease: 'power2.out', stagger: .1 })\n  .to(split.chars, { yPercent: 0, duration: .2, ease: 'power2.in', stagger: .1 }, .2);",
   "ae": "1. 텍스트 → 애니메이터: 위치 (0, -40% 상당)\n2. 레인지 셀렉터: 단위 인덱스, 끝 = 시작 + 1(1글자만 선택)\n3. 오프셋 0 → 글자 수를 0.1s/자로, 위치는 튀어오름 봉우리를 양으로\n4. 위치의 양에 ease: 오르는 구간 Ease Out / 내려가는 구간 Ease In",
   "aeEn": "1. Text → Animate: Position (0, about -40%)\n2. Range Selector: Units Index, End = Start + 1 (select a single character)\n3. Offset 0 → character count at 0.1s per character\n4. Ease the amount: Ease Out going up, Ease In coming down"
  },
