  "recipes": {
   "css": "<p role=\"status\">로딩 중<span class=\"dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i>.</i><i>.</i><i>.</i></span></p>\n\n.dots i { display:inline-block; font-style:normal; opacity:.2; animation: dot 1.2s ease-in-out infinite; }\n.dots i:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .2s; }\n.dots i:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .4s; }\n@keyframes dot { 30% { opacity:1; transform: translateY(-25%); } 60%, 100% { opacity:.2; transform:none; } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  @keyframes dot { 30% { opacity:1; } 60%, 100% { opacity:.2; } } }",
   "waapi": "const reduce = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.dots i').forEach((dot, i) => dot.animate(\n  [{ opacity: .2, transform: 'none' },\n   { opacity: 1, transform: reduce ? 'none' : 'translateY(-25%)', offset: .3 },\n   { opacity: .2, transform: 'none', offset: .6 }, { opacity: .2, transform: 'none' }],\n  { duration: 1200, delay: i * 200, iterations: Infinity, easing: 'ease-in-out' }));",
   "ae": "1. 글자와 점을 별도 레이어로(점은 3개의 '.')\n2. 점 레이어에 애니메이터: 위치 (0,-8)·불투명도 20%→\n3. 레인지 셀렉터 단위 인덱스, 오프셋 0→3을 1.2s로\n4. loopOut(\"cycle\") 로 반복한다",
   "aeEn": "1. Put the word and the dots on separate layers (three “.”)\n2. Dots layer → Animate: Position (0,-8), Opacity\n3. Range Selector Units Index, Offset 0→3 over 1.2s\n4. Repeat with loopOut(\"cycle\")"
  },
